WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.838 --> 00:00:12.685
Roxy bit her lip.

2
00:00:12.686 --> 00:00:15.845
"We have to stop the bank robber!"

3
00:00:15.846 --> 00:00:20.145
"Yes, but she probably won't rob again," Detective Smith said.

4
00:00:20.146 --> 00:00:23.109
"She already robbed every bank in the city!"

5
00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:27.335
Roxy sighed. "You're right."

6
00:00:27.336 --> 00:00:31.076
"There's one more place with money," Mrs. Betz said.

7
00:00:31.077 --> 00:00:33.812
"What's that?" Detective Smith asked.

8
00:00:33.813 --> 00:00:36.337
"The mint," Mrs. Betz said.

9
00:00:36.338 --> 00:00:38.692
"Of course!" Roxy said.

10
00:00:38.693 --> 00:00:41.209
"The robber will probably go there next.

11
00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:50.584
And I'll be waiting for her!"

12
00:00:50.585 --> 00:00:55.177
Roxy sat on a big pile of money in the mint.

13
00:00:55.178 --> 00:00:57.380
She waited and waited.

14
00:00:57.381 --> 00:01:00.296
Suddenly a small light formed on one wall.

15
00:01:00.297 --> 00:01:04.457
Roxy gasped. "A wormhole!"

16
00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:06.287
The light spun fast.

17
00:01:06.288 --> 00:01:07.874
It grew bigger.

18
00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:11.839
A woman stepped out of the wormhole.

19
00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:17.037
She grabbed some money and threw it through the wormhole.

20
00:01:17.038 --> 00:01:19.929
"Stop right there!" Roxy shouted.

21
00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:23.099
The woman looked up. "Rocket Girl!"

22
00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.259
Roxy flew toward the villain.

23
00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.276
The woman held up a blaster.

24
00:01:27.277 --> 00:01:31.754
Wha-zam! An energy blast knocked Roxy back.

25
00:01:31.755 --> 00:01:37.945
The villain jumped into the wormhole—and the wormhole disappeared!

26
00:01:37.946 --> 00:01:40.611
"Grr!" Roxy stamped her foot.

27
00:01:40.612 --> 00:01:45.496
"How will I catch the villain?"

28
00:01:45.497 --> 00:01:50.245
Terrell's phone rang. "Hello?" he whispered.

29
00:01:50.246 --> 00:01:52.611
"Terrell," Roxy said.

30
00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.817
"I'm trying to catch a bank robber.

31
00:01:54.818 --> 00:01:59.474
I need you to look up something for me—wormholes."

32
00:01:59.475 --> 00:02:02.125
Terrell did a quick search on his computer.

33
00:02:02.126 --> 00:02:09.075
"Hmm," he said. "A scientist at Metro City University does wormhole research.

34
00:02:09.076 --> 00:02:13.619
Her name is Dr. Vic Nebula. Maybe she can help you."

35
00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:23.092
"Good idea. Thanks!" Roxy said.

36
00:02:23.093 --> 00:02:28.788
Roxy arrived at the university and found Vic Nebula's lab.

37
00:02:28.789 --> 00:02:33.320
Roxy gasped. The lab was filled with money.

38
00:02:33.321 --> 00:02:36.843
"Dr. Nebula is the thief!" Roxy thought.

39
00:02:36.844 --> 00:02:39.858
The scientist stood in front of an open wormhole.

40
00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:46.615
She was holding a strange device. "Dr. Nebula!" Roxy said.

41
00:02:46.616 --> 00:02:50.458
Vic looked over. "Ugh! You're here!"

42
00:02:50.459 --> 00:02:52.644
Roxy put her hands on her hips.

43
00:02:52.645 --> 00:02:56.947
"You're a scientist. Why are you stealing money?"

44
00:02:56.948 --> 00:03:00.495
"I need a bigger lab for my research," Vic said.

45
00:03:00.496 --> 00:03:02.983
"I invented a wormhole device.

46
00:03:02.984 --> 00:03:07.948
When I'm done working on it, I'll be the most famous scientist ever."

47
00:03:07.949 --> 00:03:12.126
Roxy shook her head. "You're going to jail!"

48
00:03:12.127 --> 00:03:18.821
"No," Vic said. "I'm taking this money to a place where nobody will find it!"

49
00:03:18.822 --> 00:03:20.711
Roxy flew fast.

50
00:03:20.712 --> 00:03:23.251
Vic pressed a button on the device.

51
00:03:23.252 --> 00:03:26.692
A new wormhole appeared, and she jumped into it.

52
00:03:26.693 --> 00:03:29.653
She popped out of another wormhole behind Roxy.

53
00:03:29.654 --> 00:03:32.584
Roxy spun around and charged toward Vic.

54
00:03:32.585 --> 00:03:34.450
Vic stepped to the side.

55
00:03:34.451 --> 00:03:36.204
Roxy tried to stop.

56
00:03:36.205 --> 00:03:39.557
But she skidded—right into the wormhole!

57
00:03:39.558 --> 00:03:43.254
As the wormhole closed, Vic laughed.

58
00:03:43.255 --> 00:03:47.957
"Now nobody will ever find Rocket Girl!"
